window.products.push({"id":1190012,"name":"Centaurus Sirius-1 Gaming Computer - AMD Ryzen 5 3600X 6-Core 4.2GHz 12-Threads, 16GB 3000MHz RAM, RTX 2070 8GB, 1TB SSD, Wraith Cooler, Win 10 PRO, W","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LUfDxT-zL._AC_SL1176_.jpg","description":"New AMD Processor series based on Vishera core pushes performance and clocks with 4.4GHz frequency barrier reached in stock mode, while it can go up to 4.7GHz after overclock. Such gaming platform works great with AMD graphics cards and any Nvidia just as good, creating well balanced all around gaming machines. Since high-end FX processors come in 8-core packages you can expect perfect multi-threaded performance too. Crank all the settings to the top and enjoy your ride! This is a complete assembled system with Genuine Windows 10 pre-installed along with free Antivirus, no junk soft installed - our promise! System is ready to work out of the box, no setup necessary, just connect the monitor and keyboard/mouse. 3 Year limited warranty included, Lifetime tech support. Centaurus Sirius comes with newest AMD FX 9370 4.4GHz (4.7GHz Overclock) Vishera 8-Core processor AM3+ platform cooled by Corsair H55 liquid cooler, 16GB RAM, 990FX Extreme chipset motherboard with 6x USB 2.0 and 2x USB 3.0 ports, excellent AMD Radeon R9 380 4GB GDDR5 video card, dual PCI-e 16x slots for discrete video cards (CrossFire support), up to 32GB RAM support, DVI/VGA/HDMI/DisplayPort video out (may vary). Storage - 240GB Solid State drive for ultimate speed (Boot in less than 20 sec) + 1TB HDD for backup, DVD burner. 750W reliable power supply. Case - Corsair 230T with window, front USB 3.0, 3x 120mm silent fans (red or blue LEDs). Genuine Windows 10 64bit installed and disk included, serial key sticker attached, also available OpenOffice and antivirus software (both free). You need keyboard, mouse and monitor for this setup. If you have any questions please contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LUfDxT-zL._AC_SL1176_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Centaurus Computers","source_asin":"B00XRNETMM","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1190012","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00XRNETMM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B00XRNETMM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1190013,"name":"Jamo C60 CEN Center Channel Speaker (Single, Black)","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81AgZa8JsUS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description The C Jamo C60 CEN center channel speaker is a high performance 2-way bass-reflex center-channel speaker in a very compact package that features two heavy-duty 4\" woofers and one 1\" DTT (Decoupled Tweeter Technology) tweeter, a layout that promises seamless timbre matching with all the C 60 series models. The Jamo C60 CEN center channel speaker has been produced with the same slim form and curving lines that have given the series its visual identity and unmistakable kinship between the smallest and largest members of the Concert family. The C60 series has been developed so that it can be combined with any of the subwoofers in Jamo's new line of subs. This translates into a real \"value-for-the-money\" series, which plays much better than many of its more expensive competitors, whether you combine with a high-end Hi-Fi solution or a serious surround system. C60 CEN can be mounted either directly on the wall or placed on a video shelf. From the Manufacturer From the Manufacturer Jamo has a mission for their C - or Concert - series that they strive to fulfill every single day: To develop and market products capable of delivering a thrilling performance. Radiating the passion that went into the development, these products will feature unique technical solutions, and a recognizable design. Passion for Technology and Performance For the past 40 years Jamo has create numerous groundbreaking speakers for your listening pleasure. Each product in the C series provides ample proof of the sophisticated technology used. In Jamo's efforts to achieve perfection, they continually work to develop and fine-tune the mechanics, electronics and acoustics while satisfying the pickiest listeners around the world.   Burning passion, technological know-how and dedication - it's how Jamo create products that are best in class. Combining this with their roots and belief in the Danish design traditions of functionality, simplicity, honesty and focus on detail results in products that not only sound beautiful but also are beautiful pieces of furniture that blend easily into your home. C 60 CEN: the Finishing Touch Stylish and simple, the Jamo Concert series C 60 CEN is a high performance 2-way bass-reflex center channel speaker in a very compact package. It is the ideal addition to any home theater system, working beautifully with other Concert series speakers to give you the most lifelike movie soundtrack and music reproduction.   The C 60 CEN features two heavy-duty 4\" woofers and a 1\" DTT tweeter - a layout that provides seamless timbre matching with all the C 60 series models. The C 60 CEN can be mounted directly on the wall or placed on a video shelf. The Jamo Story It's 1966. In the fishing village of Glyngore, Denmark, carpenter Preben Jacobsen begins building loudspeakers in his henhouse. Though blessed with great woodworking skills and broad knowledge of acoustic technology, Preben soon comes to realize that selling the remarkable speakers he's built is not his strength. In 1968, he brings his brother-in-law Julius Mortensen - an experienced salesman and exporter - into the mix, and Jamo is born.   From that humble beginning, Jamo has grown to become one of Europe's largest and most respected loudspeaker manufacturers. And, as a Klipsch Group brand, Jamo has expanded into the Asian and North American markets. Through the years, Jamo has received widespread recognition for creating products with a uniquely 'Danish sound', a balance that can best be described as open, clear, coherent - and undeniably musical.   Jamo products are designed and engineered to maintain the proud Danish traditions of beauty and functionality. This is reflected in the contemporary, yet timeless, look of its creations and their use of only the highest quality materials. As a result, the speakers and other products developed by our craftsmen combine durability, simplicity and aesthetics that add to the beauty of any setting.   Jamo are suppliers of custom-designed entertainment, with a mission is to bring unique and memorable sonic experiences to your home. Whether you want music in the kitchen, the living room or on the terrace; whether you desire 2-channel stereo or a surround system, be confident that Jamo has the sound solution that's ideal for your needs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81AgZa8JsUS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jamo","source_asin":"B00120Y3NC","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1190013","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00120Y3NC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B00120Y3NC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
