window.products.push({"id":1190018,"name":"AudioQuest NRG-X2 Power Cable for Sources - 9.84 ft (3m)","category":"electronics","retail price":94.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518mpvOaqeL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"AudioQuest’s award-winning NRG-X AC power cables were loved by many—experienced audiophiles and newcomers alike—for their unrivaled combination of performance and value. Compared to stock AC power cords or even premium cables at similar or higher prices, NRG-X cables have always delivered enhanced bass definition, improved transient articulation, greater soundstage scale, and more of the precious spatial cues that bring recorded music to life. We are now delighted to offer the next generation of NRG-X AC cables, continuing the tradition of outstanding performance and exceptional value while complementing and enhancing today’s exciting electronics. These new NRG-X Series power cables use Direction-Controlled Long-Grain Copper (LGC) in a Semi-Solid Concentric Topology—a sophisticated physical arrangement in which strands are packed more tightly and never change position within the bundle. Direction-Controlled LGC minimizes distortion caused by grain boundaries that exist in any metal conductor, which in turn assures induced noise is dissipated and drained properly—as always, we direct noise where it will do the least harm to your system’s performance. In addition, the 2-pole NRG-X2 uses our super-slim C7 female end to perfectly accommodate Sonos components, gaming consoles, and more. Features: LONG-GRAIN COPPER (LGC): Long-Grain Copper (LGC) minimizes distortion caused by grain boundaries that exist within any metal conductor. SEMI-SOLID CONCENTRIC CONDUCTORS: In AudioQuest’s Semi-Solid Concentric conductor topology, strands are packed more tightly and never change position within the bundle, significantly reducing strand-interaction distortion. DIRECTION-CONTROLLED CONDUCTORS: A fundamental aspect of AudioQuest's multifaceted Noise-Dissipation technology, Direction-Controlled Conductors assure induced noise is dissipated and drained properly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518mpvOaqeL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AudioQuest","source_asin":"B0868WR4ZG","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1190018","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0868WR4ZG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0868WR4ZG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
