window.products.push({"id":1190094,"name":"Targus Sport 26L Backpack for 16-Inch Laptops, Black (TSB712US)","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ras5Dma-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Targus Sport 26L Backpack is perfect for someone on-the-go. Plenty of multi-purpose pockets and ergonomic durability makes this backpack an irresistible necessity. The Sport 26L has a compartment for every need and accessory. It comes equipped with a large padded pocket that is designed to fit laptops up to 16”, a separate sleeve for your tablet, a zippered stash pocket on the front panel, ample internal storage space and a media pocket custom fit with a built-in cord and headphone jack so that you can keep the tunes going while you walk. Comfort was also no sacrifice in the design of this backpack. To ensure that you keep going on your journey throughout the day, the Sport 26L has two ergonomic, padded shoulder straps and a padded back panel. You will hardly know you are wearing it!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ras5Dma-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Targus","source_asin":"B003JQL26I","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1190094","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003JQL26I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B003JQL26I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1190095,"name":"30FT White Premade BNC Video Power Cable/Wire for Security Camera, CCTV, DVR, Surveillance System, Plug & Play (White, 30)","category":"electronics","retail price":9.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61v1F8RfExL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cables Direct Online Premade CCTV Cables are perfect for use with security cameras. The cable carries both video and power signals, making camera cabling and installation as simple as possible. These cables uses BNC connectors for video and DC terminal connectors for power. Available in different colors and length With premade cables, they are already cut to specific lengths such as 50ft, 100ft or 150ft, and have connectors on them already. So you just have to run the wire from the camera to the DVR. For HD security cameras such as HDCVI cameras, however, you will always need to use wire from Coax Siamese Spools.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61v1F8RfExL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cables Direct Online","source_asin":"B071F1XMF1","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1190095","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071F1XMF1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B071F1XMF1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1190096,"name":"Ray Flash Ringflash Adapter for Canon 580EX II Flash with Canon 1V/1Ds/1D DSLR Cameras","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1VfaNZ+mpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Ray Flash is a unique adapter for your hot-shoe flash unit designed to replicate the lighting effect produced by traditional, expensive, and heavy powered studio ring flash units. The Ray Flash is portable and lightweight, and has been designed to take advantage of a camera's TTL metering capabilities. Because the Ray Flash relieson the hot-shoe flash to generate its light, it contains no electronics, no flash tubes and requires no cumbersome cables. The light distribution is accomplished through a sophisticated system of internal prisms, reflectors and light-shapers designed to distribute and project the light evenly around the lens. The Ray Flash creates a unique ring flash lighting effect: a three-dimensional shadow-wrapped look around the subject. Because ring flash light originates from a circle around the lens, it produces a virtually shadowless look on the front of your subject, while producing a soft even shadow around the edges. The versatile Ray Flash is ideally suited for fashion, wedding, portrait, journalistand macro photography as either a main or fill-in light. Exposure control: All TTL functions operate normally when using the Ray Flash. As with standard flash use, manual exposure control requires the use of a light meter or test-shots. The Ray Flash is designed to fit the Canon 580EX (MKI & MKII) and Nikon SB800 and SB900 flash units. Weighing about 16 oz, the Ray Flash is lightweight and is easily supporte","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1VfaNZ+mpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ray Flash","source_asin":"B001BFZ2OM","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1190096","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001BFZ2OM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B001BFZ2OM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
