window.products.push({"id":1190383,"name":"JJC Intervalometer Timer Remote Shutter Cord for Nikon P1000 P7700 P7800 D3100 D3200 D3300 D5000 D5100 D5200 D5300 D5500 D5600 D7000 D7100 D7200 D7500","category":"electronics","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51kwKNComnL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Product Description JJC TM-M Multi-functional Timer Remote Control is designed to function as a timer remote and an intervalometer. It is excellent for flower blooming, sunset, moonrise, etc. photography. The remote is equipped to handle a long list of timer functions: self-timer, long exposure timer, interval timer, as well as controlling the number of shots. An exposure as long as 99 hours, 59 minutes and 59 seconds can be programmed and number of exposures is up to 399 or unlimited. Just press the buttons, settings will display on the LCD screen. There is backlight on the LCD that allows night vision. The multi-function timer remote can also be used as a shutter release cable: Press halfway to focus; press full to trigger shutter; when taking long exposure pictures, pushing the shutter button up will lock the camera shutter. The remote also helps prevent camera shaking and allows you to take self-portraits. All the features of TM remote makes it a good helper for you to take creative pictures. Weight: 98 grams Length: 90cm Replaces Nikon MC-DC2 Remote Control Compatibility: P1000 P7700 P7800 D3100 D3200 D3300 D5000 D5100 D5200 D5300 D5500 D5600 D7000 D7100 D7200 D7500 D600 D610 D750 Df Z6 Z7 From the Manufacturer LCD Timer Remote Control for Nikon D600 D7100 D7000 D5200 D5100 D5000 D3200, replaces Nikon MC-Dc2","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51kwKNComnL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JJC","source_asin":"B008XW7T8I","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1190383","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008XW7T8I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B008XW7T8I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1190384,"name":"Arduino Uno Wifi","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Wk+0sKZ7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"the arduino uno wi-fi is the new arduino uno with an integrated wi-fi module! the board is based on the atmega328p with an esp8266 wi-fi module integrated. It has 14 digital input/output pins (of which 6 can be used as pwm outputs), 6 analog inputs, a 16 mhz ceramic resonator, a usb connection, a power jack, an icsp header, and a reset button. It contains everything needed to support the microcontroller; simply connect it toputer with a usb cable or power it with an ac-to-dc adapter or battery to get started. The esp8266 wi-fi module is a self contained soc with integrated tcp/ip protocol stack that can give access to your wi-fi network. (or the device can act as an access point. ) one useful feature of uno wi-fi is support for ota (over-the-air) programming, either for transfer of arduino sketches or wi-fi firmware. Specifications : processor esp8266 architecture tensilica xtensa lx106 operating voltage 3. 3 v flash memory 4 mb ram 8 mb instruction, 12 mb data clock speed 80 mhz wifi 802. 11 b/g/n 2. 4 ghz wake up time <2 ms ------------------------ microcontroller atmega328 architecture atmel avr 8-bit operating voltage 5 v flash memory 32 kb sram 2 kb clock speed 16 mhz analog i/o pins 6 eeprom 1 kb dc current per i/o pins 40 ma digital i/o pins 20 pwm output 6 power consumption 3 ma pcb size 3 x 68. 5 mm weight 0. 025 kg","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Wk+0sKZ7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Arduino","source_asin":"B01F63PJJM","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1190384","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01F63PJJM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B01F63PJJM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
