window.products.push({"id":1190465,"name":"Sony NPFS12 S Series Digital Camera Battery","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51FR7HN1G5L._AC_.jpg","description":"From the Manufacturer Keep a spare battery at hand with the NP-FS12 InfoLithium S Series rechargeable battery pack from Sony. It supplies 1360mAh of storage capacity for over an hour of continuous recording time, even with the camera or camcorder's viewfinder on. The NP-FS12 features a built-in microprocessor that accurately calculates the remaining power within minutes. It also doesn't have the memory effect found in other batteries, so you can charge it at any time, regardless of how much charge is remaining in the battery.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51FR7HN1G5L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sony","source_asin":"B000623HFW","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1190465","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000623HFW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B000623HFW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1190466,"name":"Sony ZV-1 Compact 4K HD Digital Camera for Content Creators (White) Bundle with Sony Accessory Kit, Memory Card Reader, Camera Bag with Cleaning Kit, ","category":"electronics","retail price":848.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Q2bqrn1RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The ZV-1 features a 1.0-type stacked Exmor RS CMOS image sensor with DRAM chip and 24-70mm F1.8-2.8 ZEISS Vario-Sonnar T* large-aperture lens creating beautiful background bokeh (background blur), allowing the subject to stand out from the background. Using Sony's leading-edge autofocus system, the camera locks on to and tracks subjects with high accuracy and speed. The ZV-1 also includes the latest-generation BIONZ X image processor with front-end LSI delivering high resolution and low noise for superior image quality. It also combines this exceptional imaging technology with high-quality and versatile audio options. The ZV-1 is Sony’s first compact camera with a side-opening Vari-angle LCD screen, making it easier to compose your shots in selfie mode while connecting external audio accessories. To meet any video need, the ZV-1 contains advanced video features including 4K movie recording and in-body image stabilization. Quickly Switch Between Two Modes of Background Bokeh The ZV-1 offers a simple solution to easily switch between two levels of background bokeh while recording. Using the new Background Defocus function, users can rapidly adjust the optical aperture between more and less background-defocusing blur without losing focus on the subject. Located on top of the camera, this Bokeh button is easily accessible and makes selfie-shooting operation a breeze. Bundle Includes: Sony ZV-1 Camera for Content Creators and Vloggers (White) Sony ZV-1 Camera for Content Creators and Vloggers (White) Sony ACCVC1 Vlogger Accessory Kit Sony ACCVC1 Vlogger Accessory Kit Camera System Gadget Bag with Accessory and Cleaning Kit Camera System Gadget Bag with Accessory and Cleaning Kit 2-in-1 USB 3.0 Memory Card Reader 2-in-1 USB 3.0 Memory Card Reader Software Bundle OEM DL Card (Photo Video Art Premium Suite) Software Bundle OEM DL Card (Photo Video Art Premium Suite)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Q2bqrn1RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sony","source_asin":"B08NC83S2M","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1190466","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NC83S2M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NC83S2M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
