window.products.push({"id":1190528,"name":"BobjGear Bobj Rugged Tablet Case for Lenovo 10e Chromebook Tablet Kid Friendly (Batfish Blue)","category":"electronics","retail price":23.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813FWtBUiPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Great looking rugged protection, custom designed by Bobj for your tablet model. (This Bobj Model does not fit any other tablet model, so check your tablet’s model in Settings, About tablet, Model number.) The high quality materials and design provide the best drop protection and shock absorption. Rugged and stylish, it also allows easy use of all functions of your tablet. The design provides easy off-screen to on-screen finger swipes which are an integral action using modern tablets. Great color choices let everyone easily identify their own tablet. The rounded front bezel helps to protect your screen if you drop your tablet face down. Front bezel tablet speakers have added protection, while a tablet’s side or rear firing speakers will benefit from increased reverberation and redirection of the sound toward the user. (see pictures). The Micro-SD card is covered for additional protection from drops or accidental loss. The advanced BobjBounces! design insures all edges are thick silicone for additional protection, and all corners provide superior corner protection while keeping a smooth, sleek look. This Bobj model has a patented design which provides continuous passive air cooling for advanced tablets that tend to run warmer. For safe use and easy maintenance, we use a high quality silicone formula which meets U.S. FDA Food Grade Requirements. It is easily cleaned with water and mild hand soap or antiseptic hand soap, and dried with a lint free cloth. The ease of cleaning, plus the rugged design and snug fit, makes your Bobj tablet protection both kid-friendly and more secure in daily use. Bobj Rugged protection is currently used in school systems and by professional businesses, but mostly by everyday tablet users who want to protect their valuable tablets. The tablet is not included with this Bobj product.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813FWtBUiPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BobjGear","source_asin":"B08DRVSF69","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1190528","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DRVSF69","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DRVSF69","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
