window.products.push({"id":1190581,"name":"Toshiba 32L1350U 32-Inch 720p 120Hz LED HDTV","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51KxkzzeWCL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Not too big, not too small, the Toshiba 32” class L1350U is the perfect sleek, slim and unobtrusive television for use as your primary TV or as an extra TV for your master bedroom. Completely new and elegantly designed with curved corners and a sleek stand, the 32” class L1350U features an energy-efficient LED backlight for bright sharp images and Clears can 120Hz technology that doubles the refresh rate for clearer fast motion video. It also features Dynamic Picture Mode for maximum contrast, clarity and color saturation and the versatility of a full set of connections. Beautifully designed and perfectly sized, you can leave it on its stand or mount it anywhere you want a TV that’s perfect for any room. From the Manufacturer Enjoy vibrant graphics for movies, games, and PC displays in one compact package with the Toshiba 32L1350U 32-Inch LED HDTV. With contoured corners and a slim design, this HDTV has a sleek profile and fits easily in small spaces. A full set of connections allows you to hook up laptops, external speakers, and USB drives. Delivers brilliant, high-contrast picture quality for movies, games, and PC displays in one compact package. View larger . User-friendly HDTV gives you the flexibility to connect to a range of devices. View larger . Slim HDTV for Movies, Games, and PC Designed to fit in small spaces while offering brilliant, high-contrast picture quality, the Toshiba 32L1350U is an ideal HDTV for kitchens, game rooms, and home offices. The included stand gives you the option of setting the television out or mounting it on a wall, so it's easily accommodated in virtually any space. Available in high-gloss black with elegant curved corners, this TV looks as great as the picture quality it delivers. Use it to enjoy the morning news with breakfast, set up a game station in the playroom, or expand your workstation. Crystal-Clear Sound and Picture Quality The features of this 720p HD television take your viewing experience to a new level, starting with the energy-efficient LED backlight that delivers bright, sharp contrast. A ColorStream HD component and built-in ColorMaster technology bring pictures to life and give you complete six-color control of hue, saturation, and brightness. And for an enriched audio experience, this HDTV is built with Audyssey EQ and ABX technologies that work together to deliver clear, well-balanced sound--ideal for getting the full experience of action movies, musical performances, and audio-enhanced games. Versatile Inputs for Full Connectivity With multiple input options, this user-friendly HDTV gives you the flexibility to connect to a range of devices. Three HDMI inputs, a USB port, a high-def PC port, and a ColorStream HD component allow you to hook it up to a Full Jack Pack or connect external speakers, AV receivers, flash drives, PCs, and laptops. The USB port lets you view media from a USB drive so you can enjoy slideshows, videos, and music without hooking up your computer--a handy solution if you are planning to wall-mount the screen. Three Modes for Multipurpose Use The Toshiba 32L1350U is equipped with three modes--Dynamic Picture Mode, Game Mode, and Cinema Mode. Delivering maximum clarity and color saturation, Dynamic Picture Mode lets you fully enjoy the intricate graphics of video games, animated films, and visual input from your laptop. Game Mode decreases controller delay for faster gaming action, while GameTimer offers parents the option of setting time limits for video game play. Cinema Mode enhances your movie watching, offering film-quality picture display. What's in the Box Toshiba 32L1350U 32-Inch LED HDTV, remote control with batteries (2 AAA), Quick Start Guide, and Warranty. Toshiba 32L1350U 32-Inch 720p 120Hz LED HDTV At a Glance: Ultra-slim, energy-efficient television for small spaces Ultra-slim, energy-efficient television for small spaces ColorMaster technology for sharp picture quality ColorMaster technology for sharp picture quality Audyssey EQ and ABX audio for clear sound Audyssey EQ and ABX audio for clear sound USB, PC, and HDMI inputs USB, PC, and HDMI inputs Three modes for improved gaming and movie watching Three modes for improved gaming and movie watching Sleek profile fits easily in small spaces. View larger . Toshiba LED HDTVs and Accessories L1350U LED HDTV L2300U 120Hz LED HDTV L4300U 1080p 120Hz Smart LED HDTV with Built-in WiFi 23-Inch 720p 60Hz 29-Inch 720p 60Hz 32-Inch 720p 120Hz 39-Inch 1080p 120Hz 50-Inch 1080p 120Hz 58-Inch 1080p 120Hz 32-Inch 720p 39-Inch 1080p 50-Inch 1080p 32-Inch 39-Inch 50-Inch 58-Inch L7300U/L7350U 1080p 240Hz Smart LED HDTV with Built-in WiFi L9300U 4K Ultra HD 240 Hz Smart LED HDTV with Built-in WiFi Symbio Media Box and Blu-ray Disc Player 50-Inch 58-inch 65-inch 58-inch 3D 65-inch 3D 58-inch 65-inch 84-inch BDX2400 BDX3400 with Built-in WiFi BDX5400 with 3D and Built-in WiFi BDX6400 Ultra HD Media Box with Built-in WiFi","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51KxkzzeWCL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Toshiba","source_asin":"B00BVKRMO0","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1190581","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BVKRMO0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BVKRMO0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
