window.products.push({"id":1190630,"name":"ORDRO EP6 Plus Head Mounted Camera 4K Video Camcorder, Wearable Video Camera UHD 1080P 60FPS Hands-Free Vlog Camera with WiFi APP Control, EIS 6.0 Ant","category":"electronics","retail price":119.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JW1NsHjGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ORDRO EP6 Plus 4K Video Camera: Newly upgraded 1/2.8-inch high-sensitivity starlight CMOS sensor, higher perceived image resolution and low noise provide more natural colors. Based on the previous generation, it has a higher resolution, combined with a more advanced image sensor, to record every moment of life at 4k 30fps. Capture What You See: Following the previous generation of head-wearable design, the concept of first-person video recording allows you to free your hands. ABS+PSC material, two-way adjustable headband, not easy to fall, the body is only 75g, light and no burden, comfortable to wear, very suitable for cycling, handicrafts, vlogs, etc. EIS 6.0 Anti-shake Technology: EP6 plus is the first ep series equipped with electronic anti-shake technology. By adjusting the \"X Y Z\" three-axis balance and combining with the algorithm, stable and clear video shooting effects can be obtained in sports scenes. This function is only available at 1080P resolution. 130° Adjustable Wide-angle: Ordro EP6 plus adds wide-angle shooting on the basis of the previous generation, up to 130°, and the EIS function is turned on to change the shooting angle to 110°. If you need to shoot objects at close range, it is recommended to turn on the new correction function of the ep series to reduce picture distortion. Added Horizontal & Vertical Screen Switching Function: One-click switching in the APP to match most short video platforms, better shooting effect and richer scenes. The exclusive \"OD Cam\" APP connects to the camera, you can view videos and pictures in real time through WiFi connection, record and edit videos in real time and share them on your social media. Equipped with remote control and wrist strap, wireless remote control is more convenient. 1000mA Large-capacity Long-life Battery: The battery life is increased from 60 minutes to 90 minutes, and the EP6 plus also supports recording while charging, so you no longer have to worry about power outages. The bottom 1/4 screw hole design supports standard tripod connection, and the video is more stable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JW1NsHjGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ORDRO","source_asin":"B0BHVJBZX8","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1190630","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHVJBZX8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHVJBZX8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1190631,"name":"DUKABEL Top Series Long 3.5mm Extension (26 Feet / 8 Meters) TRRS 4-Pole Headphone Cable Male to Female 3.5mm Audio Cable Crystal-Nylon Braided/ 24K G","category":"electronics","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RB6kFGQLL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"⭐️Looks as good as it performs: 24K gold-plated contacts, triple shielding jacket, tough nylon-braided cover, snugly-fit design, pure metal housing, and oxygen-free copper wiring, every single details we made uniquely is to ensure to present the best quality of 3.5mm Extension Cable in the market. Contemporary and with an emphasis on simplicity, DuKabel 3.5mm Extension Cable focus on pure essentials. They will go anywhere – and with anything. ⭐️Enjoy The Superior Sound: The sound quality provided by this cable is a thing of magnificence. It has 24K gold-plated contacts, which translates to squeaky-clean sound quality and seamless transmission. A shell made of pure copper is much more effective than aluminum at canceling out intrusive noise and keeping up a consistent signal reception. The triple shielding that runs through the entire length of the cable cuts out as much irrlevant noise as possible. ⭐️Designed For Perfect Fit: The 3.5mm connector features a “step-down” ring on the jack allowing plugs to be fully seated even when bulky protective cases are used which is very practical and needed feature since most smartphones and other devices are often in aftermarket cases causing problems with connection of jack and socket. DuKabel audio extension cable fits perfectly with headphones and phone cases even with tiny opening. ⭐Extends Your Joy: The DuKabel 3.5mm Male to Female Stereo Audio Cable is universally compatible. Simply connect with your 3.5mm Male to Male Stereo Audio Cable, then you can use it on many of your devices such as phones, laptops, tabs, car radios, mp3 players, portable wireless Bluetooth speakers, and more as long as they have that 3.5mm port. ***To enhance your listening experience, we recommend combining it with DuKabel Top Series 3.5mm Audio Cable. ⭐️Buy With Confidence: We’re confident in our product so we offer 12 months warranty and 100% money-back guarantee (Back up with 18-Month Extension Warranty). With an reasonable price and solid build quality, the DuKabel Top Series 3.5mm Audio Stereo Cable is something you should consider if you need a premium and durable AUX cable for your home or car. Hesitating? Please feel free to contact our friendly customer service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RB6kFGQLL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DUKABEL","source_asin":"B09L7VKD2K","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1190631","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09L7VKD2K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B09L7VKD2K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
