window.products.push({"id":1190899,"name":"LCD Adhesive Tape Repair Kit with Broken Hinge Repair Clutch Fix Kit for Apple iMac 27\" A1419 2012-2015","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+8M3ZGHeL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Compatible Models: iMac 27\" A1419 2012 2013 2014 2015 LCD display adhesive strips, replace part number #: 946-4547, 946-4548, 946-4549, 946-4550, 946-4551, 946-4552, 946-01031, 946-01032, 946-01033, 946-03774, 946-03775 Premium Gift(Opening Tool Kit) is included for all iMac machines repairs and upgrades Removing the A1418 display on iMac requires cutting through the adhesive around the perimeter of the screen. After the adhesive is cut, it cannot be used to re-seal the display in place, so you'll need to apply a new set of adhesive strips. Before you start placing strips, remove all of the old adhesive. Use a spudger to scrape up an edge, then peel with your fingers.Remove all of the remaining adhesive strips from the iMac's frame and display glass.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+8M3ZGHeL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"INYES","source_asin":"B01N5LAAZ2","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1190899","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N5LAAZ2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N5LAAZ2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1190900,"name":"Yamaha A-S301BL Natural Sound Integrated Stereo Amplifier - Black (Renewed)","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YNfBm9VOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"High Quality Circuit Design The amplifier design technology from Yamaha is called ToP–ART which features an input to output with a direct symmetrical design. ToP–ART design and ART Base ensure optimum sound when processing and transmitting the audio signal. The signal is simple and direct, therefore it is less likely to be affected by noise and distortion. The left and right channels are organized in a straight, symmetrical layout for the highest signal purity. In addition, the ART (Anti–Resonance and Tough) Base bottom chassis and a solid center bar provide high rigidity support and dampers vibration. These design innovations contribute to this amplifier's rich audio reproduction with abundant musicality. High Quality Parts for Outstanding Audio Performance Notice the custom made power transformer, custom made block capacitors, two direct signal path speaker relays, one point grounding system, extruded aluminum heat sinks and other top quality parts to effortlessly handle demanding audio conditions. The quality of each individual part, as well as how they work together, basically determines the sound quality of this component. Yamaha uses only very high quality parts, carefully selected and tested for their sound properties. Pure Direct Mode for Greater Sound Purity The Pure Direct mode causes the music signals to travel the shortest possible circuit route, bypassing the buffer amp, the tone, loudness and balance controls to virtually eliminate any signal degradation for the purest sound quality. Simple Yet Sophisticated Design With a beautiful, simple and unique design inherited directly from Yamaha Hi–Fi audio components, this amplifier also boasts an easy to operate layout. The aluminum front panel has a richly textured silver hairline finish. The control knobs are also of the same luxurious construction as used on our top end models.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YNfBm9VOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amazon Renewed","source_asin":"B07KPPB3DJ","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1190900","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KPPB3DJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KPPB3DJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
