window.products.push({"id":1190980,"name":"Pioneer 16X BDR-2209 Internal Blu-ray Burner Bundle with 3 Pack M-DISC BD and Cable Accessories (Supports BDXL, SATA Interface)","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+ItNJyO5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This product is a bundle. The Pioneer Blu-ray Burner drive model number is bdr-2209. The retail box includes an installation disc and quick installation guide documentation. The front bezel is black. The bundle includes a 3 pack of Blu-ray Disc BD, SATA cable to connect to your PC, a power connection cord to receive power from your PC, and 4 mounting screws to install the bare drive into your PC tower. The drive is 3D capable. All you need is 3D playback software and a 3D display system.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+ItNJyO5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PIONEER","source_asin":"B07VXKV7B3","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1190980","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VXKV7B3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VXKV7B3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1190981,"name":"Fotodiox Pro Lens Mount Adapter Compatible with Leica M Rangefinder Lenses to Nikon Z-Mount Mirrorless Camera Bodies","category":"electronics","retail price":63.73,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61O1k-fSvtL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The Fotodiox Pro line of adapters is crafted in Fotodiox’s factory with excellence in mind. Our adapters are manufactured with precise tolerances, providing a solid, gap free, no wiggle connection for stress free use. No adjustments needed! Fotodiox adapters are meant to be taken off and put back on your camera as much as needed while remaining as precise as the day you bought them. Fotodiox Pro adapters feature all-metal, no plastic construction to create a secure connection between your glass and camera that will not degrade over time, keeping the lens-camera connection secure with every use. We use chrome plated brass mounts for enhanced durability and reliability. Compatible Nikon Z-mount Cameras (including but not limited to): Z7, Z6, Z50 Please Note: This is a manual adapter, so lens functions that rely on electronic communication with the camera body (autofocus, AE metering, image stabilization, etc. ) will be disrupted. We state “infinity focus allowed” because our adapters are designed to be universal which can prevent some lenses from focusing to infinity at the infinity mark. Set your camera to “Manual’ or ‘Aperture Priority’ for metering. If camera does not release be sure to enable ‘shoot without lens’ in camera settings. All pictures are for illustration purposes only. Actual product may vary slightly due to ongoing improvements in design.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61O1k-fSvtL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fotodiox","source_asin":"B07YMD9WZS","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1190981","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YMD9WZS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YMD9WZS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
